{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kharnym Island Post would like to welcome you as a permanent member of our post office team, effective immediately. You will be living in the beautiful downtown Wistvale Post Office, mingle with many of the island\u2019s friendly residents, and become an essential part of our town\u2019s weekly operation with work so rewarding you\u2019ll never want to leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PROCESS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stamp and process mail from our customers, and send letters to their correct locations to keep the wheels of progress moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PACK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Efficiently prep carrier trucks to ensure a speedy delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHRED!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our state of the art shredder will get rid of any unwanted items that end up in the mail system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compensation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free room/board, weekly pay depending on experience/work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect to be contacted by your supervisor Liv very shortly, and welcome to your new home!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624790?t=1744307336","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624790?t=1744307336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/951a541bc81478baf2e1f9af44d9ffe5612c766d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744307336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/951a541bc81478baf2e1f9af44d9ffe5612c766d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744307336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kharnym Island Post would like to welcome you as a permanent member of our post office team, effective immediately. You will be living in the beautiful downtown Wistvale Post Office, mingle with many of the island\u2019s friendly residents, and become an essential part of our town\u2019s weekly operation with work so rewarding you\u2019ll never want to leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PROCESS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stamp and process mail from our customers, and send letters to their correct locations to keep the wheels of progress moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PACK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Efficiently prep carrier trucks to ensure a speedy delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHRED!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our state of the art shredder will get rid of any unwanted items that end up in the mail system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compensation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free room/board, weekly pay depending on experience/work ethic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect to be contacted by your supervisor Liv very shortly, and welcome to your new home!</p>","developers":["FlatNine Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624790/c7e235a8341bab1f0de022052d9548ea342383ff/header.jpg?t=1744307336","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Letter Lost","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl